# .gitattributes — LuxuryForm Studio (Phase 2, [ADD-1])
#
# Rationale: the Phase 2 determinism guarantee is proven by sha256 hashes of
# canonical STEP files. Git's Windows CRLF text conversion would rewrite line
# endings at checkout time and silently corrupt that hash proof on the
# operator's Windows machine. Therefore: all text is normalized to LF, and
# every binary artifact format is explicitly marked binary so it is NEVER
# CRLF-converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.step binary
*.stp binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.stl binary
*.brep binary
*.3mf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.db binary
*.pdf binary
package-lock.json text eol=lf
